It depends, so much of the current market is driven by the availability
commercial software on which ever platform you choose that the
analogy becomes distorted.

I have a standard type of plough and harness, if I can fit it to both the
oxen and the chickens then I will evaluate both sources of traction
if the chickens are the only traction source I can couple to my plough
then its the chickens. Likewise if the oxen are the only supported
solution.

