I would recommend using at least UNZIP V5.12 on any OpenVMS version
where it will run. Preferred: UNZIP V5.32 on any OVMS. UNZIP V5.40 is
the current release.

As always, .ZIP archives intended for OpenVMS can_NOT_ be unpacked on
any non-OpenVMS system. The unpacked files will be scrambled due to the
lack of RMS on non-VMS systems.

