Some offer Multias for free, so if you have the means to throw in some
memory, disk, etc, it might not be a bad deal. I personally would not
put any money into the deal, even if the Multia was free. The fan inside
isn't even powerful enough to power a wooden boat, so the parts are
kinda useless. Although, the large heatsink may ... hrm ... serve as
letter holders?

