After I aquired a VAXStation 3100 at auction last year, I thought I
could remember finding quite a bit of info  on the 'net to help identify
exactly what I had. It's been in storage for the last 12 months, and
I've just pulled it out again to try to get it net-booting (see my other
post about a blown fuse in the PSU).

I've lost track of the information I'd collected about it at that time,
and my recent efforts haven't rewarded me with much. I've tried the
sites listed in the VMS FAQ without much luck. Could someone point me in
the direction of any on-line resources that will help me out (if they're
still out there). I was disappointed to find that Digital have removed
the archived info about the VAXStations from their 'retired systems'
website.

