Sounds like it's not set up to automatically boot.  Once you get a console 
device, such as the serial terminal hooked up to it you'll need to tell it
to boot from the SCSI disk.  Do a 'SHOW DEV', figure out what device the
disk is, then tell the system to boot from it, something like 'BOOT DKA0'.

