Alain Chappuis wrote:
> 
> 
> My questions are:
> How to let to know the quantity of memory of card 3D30?
> It is possible to upgrade an additional memory for this card?
> I think that this card cannot receive additional memory?
> if so, which card to buy so that this problem is corrected?
> 3D40?
> 

There is no 3D40.  Rge 3D30 was designed in an era where cards came in
8-bit or 24-bit.  The 24-bit version could do both 8 or 24-bit or both
at the same time.

The 4D20 was the version of that card which had a 24-bit RAMDAC.  But
you will have to look around for this card, since it has been retired
(as well as the 3D30).  The right card for you to use is the 4D10T, but
it has not been qualified on that platform (we don't sell that platform
anymore), so I can't tell you if it would actually work (even if it's
not supported).



