Sounds like a problem with the graphics cards.

As Hoff recommends, try reseating all the cards and cables.

If that doesn't fix it, I would remove the VCB02 cards.  Replace them
with grant cards if you have them.  Otherwise you will need to move your
other cards over to make sure that the grant continuity stays intact.

Then see if your system works correctly from the serial console.

PS:  I have never tried it, but I have heard that if you enter a break
(F5) at the serial console, the system will switch over to it even if
the graphics cards are present.  If break doesn't work, you might try
^P.

Good luck!

