Have you checked the licenses ?
"lmf list" should tell you what you've got installed - if you look at
the line for OSF-USR, it will either be "Unlimited" or indicate the
maximum number of users.

I notice you're posting from a .ac.uk site - if your machine doesn't
have a zero-unit (unlimited) OSF-USR, do you folks have a DECcampus
subscription ? There's usually an unlimited OSF-USR licence on the PAKs
disk.

