GB)  and Lawson
> software.  Any information on how these systems
would perform would be
> greatly appreciated.  As you might guess, since
I'm posting this in a
> DEC Usenet group, that I'm trying to show the
management that the
> Alpha GS series is our best option hands
down !  Thanks.
