I run 4.0D, 4.0F and 5.0 on several DEC3000 (M600 and M800) without
problems, allthough all of them are updated with recent firmware (5.5).
You might encounter problems if your firmware is very old.

The only big difference is that all my systems have 64 MB RAM or more,
but AFAIR you can get it running with 32 MB too. To get better
performance try fetching the system tuning and configuration manual
(available as PDF somewhere on compaq.com and on the documentation
CD-ROM). In there you'll find a sysconfigtab configuration for sytems
with limited memory.


